{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2023-05-30 21:00:00', 'title': 'NEXTERA ALERT: BRAGAR EAGEL & SQUIRE, P.C. ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #A--BRAGAR EAGEL & SQUIRE, P.C., A NATIONALLY RECOGNIZED STOCKHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (“NEXTERA” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: NEE) IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF FLORIDA ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED NEXTERA SECURITIES BETWEEN DECEMBER 2, 2021, AND FEBRUARY 1, 2023, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). INVEST.'}{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2023-05-30 20:40:00', 'title': 'NEE ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JULY 25, 2023 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: NEE) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. CLASS PERIOD: DECEMBER 2, 2021 TO FEBRUARY 1, 2023 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: JULY 25, 2023 NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.'}{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2023-05-30 16:57:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: ROBBINS LLP INFORMS INVESTORS OF CLASS ACTION AGAINST NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (NEE)', 'text': "SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $NEE #NEE--NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. (NEE) FAILED TO DISCLOSE THAT FPL'S POLITICAL MISCONDUCT EXPOSED IT TO SUBSTANTIAL LEGAL AND REPUTATIONAL RISK."}{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2023-05-30 16:31:00', 'title': 'NEE INVESTOR NOTICE: ROBBINS GELLER RUDMAN & DOWD LLP ANNOUNCES THAT NEXTERA ENERGY, INC. INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE NEXTERA ENERGY CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE SUIT ALLEGES DEFENDANTS ISSUED FALSE S